<div style="width:1366px;height:768px;overflow:hidden">

<div class="card top">
  <h1>つなぐ工房</h1>
  <span class="cap">ロンリ回路をくみたてる</span>
  <div class="chips">
    <div class="chip te"><span class="k">A</span><span class="v">1</span></div>
    <div class="chip te"><span class="k">B</span><span class="v">1</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">C くりあがり</span><span class="v">1</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">S わ</span><span class="v">0</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">ためした</span><span class="v">4/4</span></div>
  </div>
  <span class="btn pk">■ 編集にもどる</span>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <span class="tg">キホン</span>
  <span class="t dn">01 スイッチ</span><span class="t dn">02 直列</span><span class="t dn">03 並列</span>
  <span class="t dn">04 NOT</span><span class="t dn">05 真理値表</span>
  <span class="tg" style="margin-left:9px">カダイ</span>
  <span class="t dn">06 XOR</span><span class="t cu">07 半加算器</span><span class="t">08 全加算器</span><span class="t">09 4ビット</span>
</div>

<div class="cols">
  <main>
    <div class="card pad" style="margin-bottom:13px">
      <h2>課題07　出口が二つある回路</h2>
      <p class="txt">課題06 でつくった <em>XOR</em> を、そのまま置きなさい。となりに <em>AND</em> を置き、
        同じ A と B をつなぎなさい。出口は二つ、<b>S</b> と <b>C</b> です。</p>
      <p class="sm">4 とおり全部ためしてから、右の表のいちばん右を見なさい。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card pad">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">BOARD</span><span class="st te">運転中　／　回路は編集できません</span></div>
      <div class="scr">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 700 262" width="100%" height="256" role="img" aria-label="半加算器">
          <g stroke="#0d9488" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none">
            <path d="M62,72 H140 V182"/><path d="M140,96 H288"/>
            <path d="M62,220 H176 V128"/><path d="M176,128 H288"/><path d="M176,220 H288"/>
            <path d="M348,200 H548"/>
            <path d="M140,182 H162 M190,182 H288"/>
            <path d="M162,182 A14,14 0 0 1 190,182"/>
          </g>
          <g stroke="#d8d2ee" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none">
            <path d="M352,112 H548"/>
          </g>
          <g fill="#0d9488"><circle cx="140" cy="96" r="6"/><circle cx="176" cy="128" r="6"/>
            <circle cx="140" cy="182" r="6"/><circle cx="176" cy="220" r="6"/></g>

          <g>
            <circle cx="56" cy="72" r="13" fill="#0d9488" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="3"/>
            <rect x="14" y="34" width="84" height="26" rx="9" fill="#0d9488"/>
            <text x="56" y="52" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#fff">A ＝ 1</text>
            <circle cx="56" cy="220" r="13" fill="#0d9488" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="3"/>
            <rect x="14" y="238" width="84" height="26" rx="9" fill="#0d9488"/>
            <text x="56" y="256" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#fff">B ＝ 1</text>
          </g>

          <g>
            <path d="M288,82 Q308,112 288,142 Q336,142 352,112 Q336,82 288,82" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M274,82 Q294,112 274,142" fill="none" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <text x="315" y="118" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="900" fill="#1b1340">XOR</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <path d="M288,170 L320,170 A30,30 0 0 1 320,230 L288,230 Z" fill="#e9fbf7" stroke="#0d9488" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <text x="312" y="206" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="900" fill="#0d9488">AND</text>
          </g>

          <g>
            <circle cx="576" cy="112" r="27" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="5"/>
            <line x1="559" y1="95" x2="593" y2="129" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <line x1="559" y1="129" x2="593" y2="95" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="614" y="98" width="78" height="28" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <text x="653" y="117" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="900" fill="#1b1340">S 和 ＝ 0</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="576" cy="200" r="34" fill="#facc15" opacity="0.3"/>
            <circle cx="576" cy="200" r="27" fill="#facc15" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="5"/>
            <line x1="559" y1="183" x2="593" y2="217" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <line x1="559" y1="217" x2="593" y2="183" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="608" y="186" width="90" height="28" rx="10" fill="#facc15" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <text x="653" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="900" fill="#1b1340">C 繰上 ＝ 1</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <aside>
    <div class="card pad" style="margin-bottom:13px">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">INPUT</span><span class="st">タップで切りかえ</span></div>
      <div class="sws">
        <div class="sb on"><div class="k">SW A</div><div class="v">1</div></div>
        <div class="sb on"><div class="k">SW B</div><div class="v">1</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lamp" style="margin-bottom:8px"><i></i>S　和<span class="v">0</span></div>
      <div class="lamp on"><i></i>C　繰上<span class="v">1</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card pad">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">TRUTH</span><span class="st vi">いちばん右の列が生えた</span></div>
      <div class="rows">
        <div class="r"><span class="p">0</span><span class="p">0</span><span class="ar">→</span>
          <span class="os"><span class="o">0</span><span class="o">0</span><span class="o dec">0＋0＝0</span></span></div>
        <div class="r"><span class="p">0</span><span class="p">1</span><span class="ar">→</span>
          <span class="os"><span class="o">0</span><span class="o">1</span><span class="o dec">0＋1＝1</span></span></div>
        <div class="r"><span class="p">1</span><span class="p">0</span><span class="ar">→</span>
          <span class="os"><span class="o">0</span><span class="o">1</span><span class="o dec">1＋0＝1</span></span></div>
        <div class="r now"><span class="p">1</span><span class="p">1</span><span class="ar">→</span>
          <span class="os"><span class="o">1</span><span class="o">0</span><span class="o dec">1＋1＝2</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">C と S を左から並べて読むと、2けたの2進数になっています。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bts">
      <span class="btn">たしかめる</span>
      <span class="btn o">ヒント</span>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

</div>
</x-dc>
</body>
</html>
